- @ref toolbox_loadbalancing "Load Balancing (Domain Decomposition)"
- @ref page_exahype_runtime_analysis "Runtime analysis"
- Offline extraction of hardcoded parameters (see @ref page_toolbox_loadbalancing_api) reconstructs split
  operations per mesh level, i.e. it emits an instruction for each level where a subtree is introduced across a
  parent–child edge (plus potential level-0 presence). The reported numberOfCells therefore counts “introduced”
  cells per level rather than only the earliest appearance.

